reading
  Every number above comes from ONE bench run, resampled. No new
  measurement was taken and none of this is a bench: it is an
  uncertainty estimate over a committed artifact.

  Where a section moves under this, it would move under a rerun, and
  a canon sentence naming it would be wrong by the following week.
  Where it does not move, this establishes only that it survives the
  weakest perturbation available, which is not the same as permanence.
